# Hierarchical Clustering - Customer Segmentation

## 📌 Project Overview
This project applies Hierarchical Clustering to segment customers based on their annual income and spending score.

## 📊 Dataset
Mall Customers dataset containing:
- Annual Income
- Spending Score

## ⚙️ Techniques Used
- Data Preprocessing (Scaling)
- Dendrogram Visualization
- Agglomerative Clustering (Ward linkage)
- Silhouette Score Evaluation

## 📈 Results
- Clear customer segments identified
- Optimal clusters chosen using dendrogram
- Silhouette score used for evaluation

## 🧠 Key Insights
- High income & high spending customers form premium segments
- Low income & high spending indicate risky behavior groups
- Clustering helps businesses target customers effectively

## 🚀 Tools
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib
- SciPy
